∇ hr←plotShow(con sql spec);html;urls
⍝ Show an Observable Plot chart in HTMLRenderer for aggregated SQL results.
⍝ con: duckdb connection
⍝ sql: presentation SQL (GROUP BY / LIMIT — aggregation in DuckDB)
⍝ spec: flat vector ('type' 'barY' 'x' 'col' 'y' 'col' ...)
⍝ hr: HTMLRenderer object name
⍝ Requires GUI (HTMLRenderer/CEF). Data path: DuckDB C API → Arrow IPC → WebSocket → Plot.
 :If 0=⎕NC'HTMLRenderer'
     ⎕SIGNAL 'HTMLRenderer is not available in this session'
 :EndIf
 :If 3≠api.⎕NC'duckdb_export_query_arrow_ipc_buffer'
     ⎕SIGNAL 'Arrow buffer export is not available (build libduckdb_arrow_ipc)'
 :EndIf
 plotCtx.con←con
 plotCtx.sql←sql
 plotCtx.spec←spec
 plotCtx.wsid←''
 plotCtx.hrName←'dbplot'
 html←plotHtml spec
 urls←(3 2⍴⊢)'ws://dyalog_root/*' 1 '*://dyalog_root/*' 1 '*cdn.jsdelivr.net*' 0
 hr←plotCtx.hrName ⎕WC'HTMLRenderer' html ('InterceptedURLs' urls) ('Event' 'All' 'plotShowWebSocket')
 hr.Size←480 720
∇
